		-- Stock transfers. Every status (draft / waiting / confirmed / ready / done / cancelled)
		-- and every operation_code appears. Notable scenarios:
		--   XFER0001..0003  a three-step inbound chain at the central DC, tied by chain_group_id
		--                   (receipt -> quality check -> putaway), all done.
		--   XFER0004..0006  a three-step outbound chain (pick -> pack -> ship), pick/pack done and
		--                   the delivery still ready, so partially-progressed chains are covered.
		--   XFER0007/0008   a partially delivered order and the backorder it spawned
		--                   (backorder_of_id), which is what backorder_policy = always produces.
		--   XFER0009        a customer return referencing the delivery it reverses (return_of_id).
		--   XFER0010/0011   an inter-warehouse resupply through the transit location: goods leave
		--                   the central DC and are received at the north warehouse.
		--   XFER0015        cancelled, and XFER0016 draft, so both terminal-but-not-done states
		--                   are present.
